      "id": "claim_8d591a5af58a41fc93e5fa8b7a33dadf",
      "statement": "The shared --kms flag documents the URI grammar kmstype:[key=value;...]?[key=value&...] and the supported types: yubikey:, pkcs11:, tpmkms:, cloudkms:, awskms:, and azurekms: with their parameters.",
