      "id": "claim_5ca3b85b806742c6a70061fad37e18bd",
      "statement": "cryptoutil.IsKMS implements the file-wins convention: it returns false when a file exists at the given path even if the path matches a KMS URI pattern, and otherwise requires kms.TypeOf to identify a non-default KMS.",
