      "id": "claim_ba6b18ef86cb4b94991745811727a9b5",
      "statement": "The cryptoutil accessors take (kmsURI, name) and dispatch file-vs-KMS: PublicKey and CreateSigner use pemutil.Read for files (requiring a crypto.PublicKey/crypto.Signer), LoadCertificate reads a bundle or runs step-kms-plugin certificate, and LoadJSONWebKey wraps KMS signers in jose.NewOpaqueSigner deriving the algorithm per key type (ES256/384/512, RS256, EdDSA) and kid from the JOSE thumbprint — enabling JWK and X5C tokens signed with HSM-held keys.",
